module gunbc.qualified_pipe_callee_seed_growth

import std.decl_ref { DeclarationRef, WholeDeclaration }
import std.types { String }
import gunbc.roadmap_model { RoadmapNodeId }
import gunbc.seed_growth { SeedGrowthJustification }

// Seed-growth obligation for the discriminating evidence behind the
// qualified-callee-in-pipe-position repair. Homed beside the obligation it declares rather than
// inside gunbc.seed_growth_admission, which owns the ROSTER and the join and would otherwise
// accumulate every lane's rows in the module that adjudicates them.
//
// WHAT THE CHANGE WAS, since the growth is defensible only relative to it: v1.compiler.parse
// parse_pipe_rhs consumed exactly one identifier after the pipe arrow, so a qualified callee in
// pipe position had its ROOT SEGMENT lowered as a method on the receiver — remaining segments
// folding on top as field access — while the same callee in ordinary call position resolved
// correctly. One authored denotation, two answers, decided by syntactic position. The repair
// consumes the whole dotted path and hands the leading segments to the qualifier spine that
// v1.compiler.infer's qualified_direct_call arm already reads, so both positions reach ONE
// resolution path.
//
// WHY THE TEST FILE IS ENUMERATED: seed_growth_forward_freeze_policy_note names 'hand-written
// src/v1 Rust' with exactly two exclusions — deleting existing Rust, and netting deletions against
// additions — and neither exempts tests. gunbc.stage0_rust_source_lifecycle_scaffold declares
// rust_source_prefix_stage0_test as 'src/v1/stage0/tests/' and lists it among the discovery prefix
// hints, so the stage0 test tree is a DECLARED Rust source class. Precedent in shape:
// gunbc.parse_refusal_location_seed_growth, authored one lane earlier for the same reason.
//
// NO NEW UNCITABLE ITEM: all seven additions are free functions, each nameable as a DeclarationRef
// with WholeDeclaration. No struct, no impl block, so none of the impl-method class
// gunbc.seed_growth_admission reports separately in seed_growth_uncitable_item_keys.

data qualified_pipe_callee_seed_growth_justification: SeedGrowthJustification = SeedGrowthJustification {
  hand_authored_declarations: [
